- MILESTONE: Audit accepted → `done`. Every load-bearing claim reproduced from upstream: tag→commit pins for both candidates plus all six transitive deps (ls-remote), all three archive SHA-256 and both license hashes (fresh downloads), 16 MiB window `SSHChannelMultiplexer.swift:211`, internal `_rekey()` `NIOSSHHandler.swift:511`, libssh2 window APIs and direct-tcpip hardcode `src/channel.c:384,457`, unexported reexchange `src/packet.c:1369`, version-macro anomaly, six CVE fix commits confirmed ancestors of `a343024`, GHSA advisories via API, exactly 679 libssh2 commits/12mo.
